  "details": "I saw that someone already had this idea as well from as far as back as 2019, but I think with VRChat growing and the avatar creator market always growing, we need the ability to upload to other people's account without them having to give up private info which will happen as things are even with it being against TOS, many people are not tech savvy enough to figure out unity, and most quest users don't even have access to a PC, I believe a simple token generator you could give to someone for uploads would be a great idea.",
